@startuml core-flow-sequence
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title CORE FLOW AS-IS - ORDER, PAYMENT VÀ DISPENSING COMMAND

actor "API consumer" as Client
participant Gateway
participant "Order Service" as Order
participant "Identity Service" as Identity
participant "Machine Service" as Machine
participant "Catalog Service" as Catalog
database order_db as DB
actor "Payment Provider" as Provider
participant "Device adapter\n<<future extension>>" as Device #EAF2F8

== Create order ==
Client -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/orders + Bearer token
Gateway -> Order : sanitized request
Order -> Identity : POST /internal/auth/introspect\nX-Internal-Service-Key
Identity --> Order : AccountPrincipal
Order -> Machine : GET /internal/machines/{machineId}/slots/{slotId}
Machine --> Order : authoritative slot snapshot
Order -> Catalog : GET /internal/catalog/order-products/{productId}
Catalog --> Order : authoritative product/price snapshot
Order -> DB : save Order(PENDING) + OrderItem
Order --> Client : 201 OrderResponse

== Payment ==
Client -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/payments/qr
Gateway -> Order : request
Order -> DB : create/find Payment(PENDING)
Order --> Client : PaymentResponse + QR payload
Provider -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/payments/callback
Gateway -> Order : callback + callback token
Order -> DB : idempotency check; Payment=PAID; Order=CONFIRMED
Order -> Machine : POST /api/machines/dispense-commands
Machine --> Order : 202 ACCEPTED
Order -> DB : save DispensingCommand(ACCEPTED)
Order --> Provider : 200 PaymentResponse

== Poll result ==
Client -> Gateway : GET /api/v1/orders/{id}/dispensing
Gateway -> Order
Order -> Machine : GET /api/machines/dispense-commands/{commandId}
Machine --> Order : current command status
alt terminal DISPENSED / FAILED
  Order -> DB : update command and order
  Order --> Client : terminal DispensingResponse
else non-terminal ACCEPTED / PROCESSING / ACKNOWLEDGED
  Order --> Client : non-terminal DispensingResponse
end

note over Machine,Device
  Hiện chưa có adapter gọi MachineCommand.acknowledge()/complete().
  Device chỉ là điểm mở rộng để tích hợp sau này.
end note

@enduml
